                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game suprise me... I bought it without expecting much... but its great!\nA really beautiful and funny game.\n\nI'll try to write something usefull for the little that I played:\n\nIMPORTANT: the game becomes really interesting from Level 7. But level 3 and 5 was great diferent maps too.\n\nGraphics:\nI love it. I believe the graphics and animations are the strongest point in Orange Adventure. It's a refreshing thing between so many pixel art indie shits steam has.\n\nGameplay:\nsimple, but no less fun. The rollercoaster levels reminded me donkey kong country, and i think the airplane levels will be great too. perhaps the character should be able to jump down, but it does not bother not happen. \n\nHistory:\nI do not care history in this kind of games, I think it's perfect to play around and have fun. So this point is not important to me.\n\nPrice:\nI think is ok. Maybe 5 usd will be better, but anyway, the game is ok with all the diferent things.\n\nWell... Orange Adventure is a very good game for price, fulfills all its promises and I played what I can say is highly recommended.",
